TIP:  Notes may or may not transpose.  The intro has a distinct attack pattern.  Untransposed, the 5 - 4 - 3 strings are the key.  So what you want to do is begin by forming (Asus2) and downstroke the 5 - 4 - 3 strings twice (without hitting the 2nd string), and then pick once on the upstroke the bottom, 2nd, 3rd, and 4th string, then drop down and pick the 3rd string again.  Repeat this pattern again and do the same thing for the rest of the chords in the intro. 


